le-First View</div></div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-[10px]"><div class="w-[16px] h-[16px] rounded-full border border-[#E8B87A]/40 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-[5px] h-[5px] rounded-full bg-[#E8B87A]"></div></div><div class="font-sans text-[12px] text-[#FFFDF8] opacity-65">Live Website Builder</div></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2px] min-h-[200px] md:min-h-[240px] md:col-start-3 md:row-start-2"><img alt="Simran &amp; Harpreet" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 25%;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 30vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpub-1cc0f6e993214be9a36badeeb631f4b6.r2.dev%2Fimages%2FTestimonial%2FTestimonial%204.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_G4Ap9b22R4wi7tt29st6JJ6ki8N1"/><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 20%, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 100%)"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full p-[20px] flex flex-col items-start"><div class="text-[#E8B87A] text-[8px] tracking-[2px] mb-[6px]">★★★★★</div><p class="font-serif italic font-light text-[15px] text-[#FFFDF8] leading-[1.4] mb-[8px]">&quot;Built our Anand Karaj website in 12 minutes. Our London guests said it was the most beautiful invite they had ever received.&quot;</p><div class="font-sans text-[9px] tracking-[2px] text-[#E8B87A] opacity-80 uppercase mb-[8px]">SIMRAN &amp; HARPREET · AMRITSAR</div><div class="bg-[#E8B87A]/15 border-[0.5px] border-[#E8B87A]/30 py-[3px] px-[8px] font-sans text-[7px] tracking-[2px] text-[#E8B87A] uppercase rounded-sm">USED: WEBSITE BUILDER</div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#E8B87A] via-[#C17F4A] via-[#E8B87A] to-transparent"></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section class="relative bg-[#FAF0E6] flex flex-col w-full text-[#8B3C14] overflow-hidden"><div class="relative w-full pt-[60px] px-6 md:pt-[100px] md:px-[60px] pb-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none text-[#C17F4A]" style="opacity:0.025"><svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><pattern id="toile" x="0" y="0" width="100" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M10 10 Q 20 5, 30 10 T 50 10" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"></path><circle cx="25" cy="25" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M40 40 Q 45 45, 50 40 T 60 40" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"></path><circle cx="55" cy="55" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M80 80 C 85 70, 95 70, 100 80" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"></path></pattern></defs><rect x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#toile)"></rect></svg></div><div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-[1100px] mx-auto mb-[72px]"><div class="font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[5px] text-[#C17F4A] opacity-75 mb-[14px] uppercase font-medium">HOW IT WORKS</div><h2 class="font-serif italic font-light text-[34px] md:text-[48px] leading-[1.05] text-[#8B3C14]">Your <span class="text-[#C17F4A]">perfect Shaadi</span><br/>in four simple steps</h2><p class="font-sans font-light text-[13px] text-[#6B4A2A] opacity-55 max-w-[400px] mx-auto mt-[12px] leading-relaxed">From first click to final dance —<br/>ShaadiPath guides every moment</p></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1100px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-y-12 md:gap-y-0 pb-[80px]"><div class="hidden md:block absolute top-[28px] left-[12.5%] right-[12.5%] h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#C17F4A]/30 to-transparent z-0"></div><div class="hidden md:block absolute top-[28px] left-[12.5%] w-[75%] h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#C17F4A]/60 to-transparent z-0 origin-left"></div><div class="relative text-center px-5 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="step-circle w-[56px] h-[56px] rounded-full border border-[#C17F4A]/30 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FFFDF8] relative z-10 shadow-[0_2px_12px_rgba(139,60,20,0.08)] mb-5"><span class="font-serif text-[22px] leading-none text-[#8B3C14]">01</span></div><div class="step-text-container"><h3 class="font-serif italic text-[18px] text-[#8B3C14] mb-2 leading-[1.2]">Discover Your Wedding</h3><p class="font-sans font-light text-[11px] text-[#6B4A2A] opacity-60 leading-[1.6]">Play 4 games. Get your free Wedding Intelligence Report in 8 minutes.</p></div></div><div class="relative text-center px-5 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="step-circle w-[56px] h-[56px] rounded-full border border-[#C17F4A]/30 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FFFDF8] relative z-10 shadow-[0_2px_12px_rgba(139,60,20,0.08)] mb-5"><span class="font-serif text-[22px] leading-none text-[#8B3C14]">02</span></div><div class="step-text-container"><h3 class="font-serif italic text-[18px] text-[#8B3C14] mb-2 leading-[1.2]">Plan Every Detail</h3><p class="font-sans font-light text-[11px] text-[#6B4A2A] opacity-60 leading-[1.6]">AI-powered planner and timeline keeps you ahead of every decision.</p></div></div><div class="relative text-center px-5 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="step-circle w-[56px] h-[56px] rounded-full border border-[#C17F4A]/30 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FFFDF8] relative z-10 shadow-[0_2px_12px_rgba(139,60,20,0.08)] mb-5"><span class="font-serif text-[22px] leading-none text-[#8B3C14]">03</span></div><div class="step-text-container"><h3 class="font-serif italic text-[18px] text-[#8B3C14] mb-2 leading-[1.2]">Build Your Website</h3><p class="font-sans font-light text-[11px] text-[#6B4A2A] opacity-60 leading-[1.6]">Pick a template, fill details, share with guests. Ready in 10 minutes.</p></div></div><div class="relative text-center px-5 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="step-circle w-[56px] h-[56px] rounded-full border border-[#C17F4A]/30 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FFFDF8] relative z-10 shadow-[0_2px_12px_rgba(139,60,20,0.08)] mb-5"><span class="font-serif text-[22px] leading-none text-[#8B3C14]">04</span></div><div class="step-text-container"><h3 class="font-serif italic text-[18px] text-[#8B3C14] mb-2 leading-[1.2]">Assemble Your Team</h3><p class="font-sans font-light text-[11px] text-[#6B4A2A] opacity-60 leading-[1.6]">Discover verified vendors and venues that match your budget and vibe.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative bg-[#8B3C14] pt-[100px] px-6 md:px-[60px] pb-[80px] w-full text-center overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0" style="background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(232,184,122,0.04) 0, rgba(232,184,122,0.04) 28px, transparent 28px, transparent 56px)"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[90%] max-w-[700px] h-[400px] bg-[rgba(201,168,76,0.10)] rounded-[100%] blur-[60px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none text-[#FFFDF8]" style="opacity:0.02"><svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><pattern id="toile" x="0" y="0" width="100" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M10 10 Q 20 5, 30 10 T 50 10" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"></path><circle cx="25" cy="25" r="2" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M40 40 Q 45 45, 50 40 T 60 40" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"></path><circle cx="55" cy="55" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M80 80 C 85 70, 95 70, 100 80" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="0.5"></path></pattern></defs><rect x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#toile)"></rect></svg></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-[10px] mb-[28px]"><div class="w-[60px] h-[0.5px] bg-[#E8B87A] opacity-30"></div><div class="flex gap-[6px]"><div class="w-1 h-1 rotate-45 bg-[#E8B87A] opacity-60"></div><div class="w-1 h-1 rotate-45 bg-[#E8B87A] opacity-60"></div><div class="w-1 h-1 rotate-45 bg-[#E8B87A] opacity-60"></div></div><div class="w-[60px] h-[0.5px] bg-[#E8B87A] opacity-30"></div></div><h2 class="font-serif italic font-light text-[38px] md:text-[56px] text-[#FFFDF8] leading-[1.05] mb-2">Where every <span class="text-[#E8B87A]">Shaadi</span><br/>becomes a story</h2><p class="font-sans font-light text-[14px] text-[#FFFDF8] opacity-45 max-w-[440px] mx-auto leading-[1.7] mb-[56px]">Join thousands of couples who planned their perfect wedding with ShaadiPath — free to start, beautiful from day one.</p><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center w-full mb-[48px]"><div class="swipe-container-elements flex flex-col items-center gap-[16px] w-full"><div class="swipe-label font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[3px] text-[#FFFDF8] opacity-40 uppercase">swipe to begin your journey</div><div class="swipe-track w-[300px] md:w-[340px] h-[64px] rounded-[100px] bg-black/25 border border-[#E8B87A]/20 relative overflow-hidden cursor-pointer touch-none"><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 rounded-[100px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#E8B87A]/15 to-[#E8B87A]/5" style="width:0%;transition:width 0.1s"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center font-serif italic text-[15px] text-[#FFFDF8] tracking-[1px] pointer-events-none" style="opacity:0.35">Haan ji, hum tayaar hain 💍</div><div class="absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] z-10 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing" style="left:0;x:6px;background-color:#E8B87A;will-change:auto"><span class="text-[20px] transition-all duration-300">💍</span></div></div><div class="flex gap-[6px] items-center font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[2px] text-[#FFFDF8] opacity-30 mt-2 transition-opacity duration-300" style="opacity:0.3"><span class="inline-block animate-[pulseX_1.5s_ease-in-out_infinite]">→</span> Slide to start planning</div></div><div class="success-message hidden flex-col items-center gap-2 absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full"><div class="font-serif italic text-[22px] text-[#E8B87A]">Bahut achha! Your journey begins ✨</div><div class="font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[3px] text-[#FFFDF8] opacity-40 uppercase">Taking you to your wedding report...</div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center z-10"><div class="font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[3px] text-[#FFFDF8] opacity-20 mb-[16px]">or</div><a class="font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[2px] text-[#E8B87A] opacity-50 underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity" href="/vendors">skip straight to vendors →</a></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-[12px] mt-[40px] z-10"><div class="flex -space-x-2"><div class="w-[28px] h-[28px] rounded-full border-2 border-[#8B3C14] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-sans font-medium text-white shadow-sm" style="background-color:#C17F4A;z-index:40">P</div><div class="w-[28px] h-[28px] rounded-full border-2 border-[#8B3C14] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-sans font-medium text-white shadow-sm" style="background-color:#6B2A0A;z-index:30">A</div><div class="w-[28px] h-[28px] rounded-full border-2 border-[#8B3C14] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-sans font-medium text-white shadow-sm" style="background-color:#D4822A;z-index:20">S</div><div class="w-[28px] h-[28px] rounded-full border-2 border-[#8B3C14] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-sans font-medium text-white shadow-sm" style="background-color:#8B3C14;z-index:10">R</div></div><div class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#FFFDF8]/45"><span class="font-bold text-[#E8B87A]">2,847</span> couples started their<br class="md:hidden"/> journey this month</div></div></div></div><footer class="w-full bg-[#2A1A0A] py-[32px] px-[24px] md:py-[40px] md:px-[60px] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-[16px] z-10 relative"><div class="font-serif italic text-[24px] text-[#E8B87A] opacity-50 text-center md:text-left">ShaadiPath</div><div class="flex gap-[24px]